><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>36</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>36</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the area of the rectangle <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"39\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"40\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 5.903em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.3em;\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c41 TEX-